# r3f (docs/r3f-kernel.md): the r3e1 series (r3e.series plus r3e/0076) rebased onto aurora-silicon/linux main 4abf0f83c290
# (144 commits after r3e's c3369f4855e9). Two patches dropped: r3e/0023 (the dark wake count, #2559: merged as af97a52c0a5)
# and r3e/0019 (the K114s default of fw27_panel_edr_max_nits = 500, dropped by the owner's decision to use upstream's
# EDR value, #2694). Two re-cut onto #2694 (r3e/0017 and r3e/0018, a conflict in dcp_panel_read_adt()); the other 72 applied
# as they were. The camera patches (r3f/0073, the camera without a described light, and r3f/0074, the small indicator)
# are kept. Deep sleep stays compiled out (CONFIG_APPLE_SOC_SLEEP off), as in r3d and r3e.
